{"action": "create", "after_sha256": "sha256:c2b5775b505bb2b275103f63d5b3b0dbf73958073f4d66f8a43c8d8510d6ba2c", "before": null, "bytes": 3567, "candidate_id": "2016-xiayanjing-zhongguo-yishu-shejishi-upgrade:cand-05-38", "entity": "联珠鹿纹锦", "lines": 74, "note": "新建 works/lianzhu-luwen-jin.md。夏燕靖 2016 L2650、同节 L2659-L2665。图注作“6-15. 唐代 联珠鹿纹锦”，正文未单述此锦，只在“锦”一节总述唐锦以纬锦为主、风格与母题分类，段末以（图6-15、6-16）统摄。", "target_ref": "04-knowledge/units/works/lianzhu-luwen-jin.md"}
{"action": "create", "after_sha256": "sha256:555683d9f7fbd0ee18e8da4489f96feeb483adcfaa57e3007465fcd99b23ea11", "before": null, "bytes": 3969, "candidate_id": "2016-xiayanjing-zhongguo-yishu-shejishi-upgrade:cand-05-52", "entity": "《步辇图》", "lines": 76, "note": "新建 works/buniantu.md。夏燕靖 2016 L2723、L2736、L2756。原文在品色衣段以画中汉族男子（包括太宗）皆着幞头袍衫、只以颜色为别佐证贞观四年与上元元年的服色规定，女服段又与《捣练图》《簪花仕女图》《韩熙载夜宴图》并列说明唐300年裙装变化。", "target_ref": "04-knowledge/units/works/buniantu.md"}
