{"action": "create", "after_sha256": "sha256:d0ae81c69dc1a3a9c9e71e32f1273239d5f05fcb1b3290f583d0d6ba6bb96f02", "before": null, "bytes": 4734, "candidate_id": "2016-xiayanjing-zhongguo-yishu-shejishi-upgrade:cand-05-59", "entity": "文思院造鎏金朵带银熏炉", "lines": 78, "note": "新建 works/wensiyuan-yin-xunlu.md。夏燕靖 2016 L2808、L2811。原文给出实测（通高29.5厘米、盖径25.9厘米、腹深7厘米、重5.363千克）、成型与纹饰、铭文“咸通十年（869）文思院造”与1987年法门寺地宫出土、现藏法门寺博物馆；与 places/famen-si-digong.md 所记李立新称鎏金卧龟莲花纹朵带五足银熏炉疑为同器异名，未合并。", "target_ref": "04-knowledge/units/works/wensiyuan-yin-xunlu.md"}
{"action": "create", "after_sha256": "sha256:fbd88ce524ee6faa8b2f1d3aa8a7b48dc6815514b25d8040f59a05ba85b7d181", "before": null, "bytes": 3479, "candidate_id": "2016-xiayanjing-zhongguo-yishu-shejishi-upgrade:cand-05-63", "entity": "五牙大战舰", "lines": 75, "note": "新建 works/wuya-dazhanjian.md。夏燕靖 2016 L2855。原文记隋代五牙大战舰高10余丈、可乘800人，与隋炀帝下江南数千艘随行船、4层殿堂长20余丈的龙舟并举例；未说明“五牙”是船名还是船型等级。", "target_ref": "04-knowledge/units/works/wuya-dazhanjian.md"}
